{"id":"00040","root":"uni00040_1","name":{"ja":"シュヴァリエ","en":"Chevalier"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"シュヴァリエ","en":"Chevalier"},"element":"Spiritual","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Magic"],"release":"2018-09-25","limited":false,"characterId":38,"profile":{"ja":"魔界の子爵階級を持っている魔族。家には古代の書物が山のようにあり古の魔術などを研究し魔界の錬金術師と呼ばれている。争い事にはあまり興味はないが、研究を邪魔する者には容赦なく自身が持っている古代の魔術を用いて撃退する。人間界などたまに外の世界に行き珍しい書物と生物を捕獲していくことがある。","en":"Chevalier is a demon of baron rank in the Demon Realm. Her home is stacked with ancient tomes, and she studies old sorcery, earning her the reputation of a Demon Realm alchemist. She has little interest in disputes, but she shows no mercy to anyone who hinders her research, repelling them with the ancient magic she wields. Occasionally she ventures into the outside world, such as the Human Realm, to capture rare books and creatures."},"illustrator":"のぶしと","voiceActor":"柊 奈々","forms":[{"id":"uni00040_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[764,1528],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[111,222],"def":[97,194],"spd":[56,56],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":37,"skills":["3","99"]},{"id":"uni00040_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1128,2256],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[172,344],"def":[144,288],"spd":[56,56],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":37,"skills":["3","99","100"]},{"id":"uni00040_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1492,2983],"sp":[320,320],"atk":[233,467],"def":[191,383],"spd":[56,56],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":37,"skills":["3","99","100"]}],"skills":{"3":{"slot":"attack","id":3,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Spiritual damage"}]},"99":{"slot":"skill1","id":99,"name":{"ja":"古代魔術"},"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level